        "condition": { "math": [ "robofac_pat_lost_signal_highlands == 1" ] }
      },
      {
        "text": "During the storm, something…  spoke to me…  and took me there.  It's hard to explain.",
        "topic": "TALK_ROBOFAC_MERC_PAT_POI_lost_signal_portal_storm_dungeon",
        "condition": { "math": [ "robofac_pat_lost_signal_portal_storm_dungeon == 1" ] }
      },
      {
        "text": "I got tangled up in these webs, and then all of a sudden I'm in some sort of cavern, with the biggest spider I've ever seen.",
